00:21:05.019 --> 00:21:06.610
Mike White: For sure.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:11.680
First off, we really looked at moving to the
cloud as a way to transform the way we develop

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:12.680
software.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:16.480
And I can tell you it has been really transformative
from us from a software development perspective.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:19.559
Currently we have about 500 projects in the
cloud.

00:21:19.559 --> 00:21:24.289
That includes everything from customer-facing
or guest-facing products in production we

00:21:24.289 --> 00:21:28.130
