00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:43.429
As you mentioned, we are ahead of schedule.

00:21:43.429 --> 00:21:46.559
That's really a testament to -- you said the
word "partnership" earlier.

00:21:46.559 --> 00:21:51.120
It truly is a partnership we developed with
Google that has been really helpful for us.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.230
So thank you for that.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:53.340
Diane Greene: Oh, you're welcome.

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:59.020
I think our teams just really clicked and
