00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:38.170
And the way we look at our developers is they
are technologists that are storytellers.

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:41.510
For us, we use technology in service of the
story.

00:22:41.510 --> 00:22:42.620
That's what we do at Disney.

00:22:42.620 --> 00:22:45.220
That's been our legacy since Walt.

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:49.250
So we've really been able to focus on telling
great stories.

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:54.850
And with that, we've been really taking a
machine learning mindset as we're on our road

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:56.309
