00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:41.850
So those are customer facing and back-end
as well.

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:44.460
We look at that as kind of a symbiotic relationship.

00:23:44.460 --> 00:23:50.760
Diane Greene: You know, I just love your mission
