control, while still benefiting, you know,

00:33:46.490 --> 00:33:52.200
from the agility, the scale, the presence
of a public cloud, and we see this joint solution

00:33:52.200 --> 00:33:59.580
as the basis for a new way to approach compliance
and governance in public cloud environments.

00:33:59.580 --> 00:34:03.450
Bernd Leukert: I completely agree, Diane.

00:34:03.450 --> 00:34:09.060
And being with Google Cloud ensures, from
my perspective, deployment to the greatest

00:34:09.060 --> 00:34:15.589
